  "title": "Cornbread and Sausage Stuffing",
  "description": "Use a pre-baked pan of corn bread in this stuffing for turkey, chicken or pork loin chops. You can freeze what you don't use for future meals.",
  "authors": [
    "barbara"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-09-21T11:00:46-04:00",
